  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Saferworld 2014-2017 - Saferworld 2014-2015</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Saferworld 2014-2017</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">1. Ensure the development and effective delivery of responsive, accountable and locally-appropriate security and justice, as a means towards conflict transformation
2. Challenge gender norms that cause and perpetuate conflict and insecurity
3. Prevent and reduce the impact of external factors on security and peace, including the proliferation and misuse of conventional weapons and the implementation of state-building/stabilization strategies with potential to fuel conflict.
4. Ensure international political, economic, development and security engagement in conflict-affected contexts is sensitive to conflict dynamics and contributes to sustainable peace
5.Promote accountable, fair and inclusive governance systems and peacebuilding processes that address the root causes of conflict.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Core support to Saferworld who works to prevent conflict and to strengthen human security through supporting local, national and international efforts for peace and security. Beside policy and advocacy work on international level, Saferworld is working in around twenty countries/regions towards three &quot;peace conditions&quot; -  people&apos;s participation in transition from conflict and in peacebuilding; access to justice and effetive means to manage abuse and injustice driving conflict; and decision-makers use their power to favour justice and equality.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">K&#xe4;rnst&#xf6;d till Saferworld som arbetar f&#xf6;r att f&#xf6;rebygga konflikt och st&#xe4;rka m&#xe4;nsklig s&#xe4;kerhet genom att st&#xf6;dja lokal, nationella och internationella anst&#xe4;ngningar f&#xf6;r fred och s&#xe4;kerhet. F&#xf6;rutom policy- och p&#xe5;verksansarbete p&#xe5; internationell niv&#xe5; arbetar 
Saferworld i ett 20-tal l&#xe4;nder och regioner f&#xf6;r att tre &quot;peace conditions&quot; ska f&#xf6;rverkligas; att m&#xe4;nniskor deltar och har en aktiv roll i &#xf6;verg&#xe5;ng fr&#xe5;n konflikt och i fredsbyggande insatser; har tillg&#xe5;ng till r&#xe4;ttvisa och effektiva kanaler f&#xf6;r att hantera &#xf6;vergrepp och or&#xe4;ttvisor som driver konflikten; och makthavare ut&#xf6;var sin makt f&#xf6;r att fr&#xe4;mja ett r&#xe4;ttvist och j&#xe4;mlikt samh&#xe4;lle.</narrative>
  </description>
